# Local development env
# Copy to `.env.localhost` when you want localhost to use a separate config.
#
# Recommended:
# - keep localhost on disabled / legacy_jwt
# - use app-rem.remi.run for real Clerk login verification
#
# Example:
# PORT=3001
# REMI_AUTH_MODE=legacy_jwt
# NEXT_PUBLIC_REMI_AUTH_MODE=legacy_jwt
# JWT_SECRET=replace-me
#
# Optionally inherit everything else from `.env` by copying it first:
#   cp .env .env.localhost
# Then override only the auth-related keys above.
